; selftest-refuse.eval - handed to the runner by `Eval.ps1 -SelfTest`; must PASS.
;
; The half of `expect-refuse` that keeps a probe from failing its own run: each
; line below is refused by the command's own rule, so none of them counts.
; (0,0 of the demo's world map is water.)
logecho on
reset
expect-refuse worldprops start 0 0
state
